{"duration": 73.977, "exact_word_timing": true, "lines": [{"beat": 0, "text": "Tycho Brahe measured stars by eye, then built a castle around them.", "start": 0.08, "end": 3.85}, {"beat": 0, "text": "Tycho's naked-eye readings had to be exact.", "start": 4.07, "end": 6.5}, {"beat": 0, "text": "King Frederick II wanted to keep this famous astronomer in Denmark.", "start": 6.72, "end": 10.546}, {"beat": 1, "text": "Tycho's father wanted him to practice law.", "start": 10.966, "end": 13.254}, {"beat": 1, "text": "Tycho chose astronomy and complained that society wasted his time.", "start": 13.474, "end": 17.274}, {"beat": 1, "text": "Frederick II heard about Tycho's plans to leave Denmark.", "start": 17.494, "end": 20.794}, {"beat": 1, "text": "So the king offered Hven and funding in 1576.", "start": 21.014, "end": 24.441}, {"beat": 2, "text": "Tycho began building Uraniborg in 1576 and moved there soon after.", "start": 24.861, "end": 29.401}, {"beat": 2, "text": "As lord of Hven, he made farmers grow twice as much and build his castle.", "start": 29.621, "end": 33.869}, {"beat": 2, "text": "The farmers complained about heavy taxes and took Tycho to court.", "start": 34.089, "end": 37.483}, {"beat": 2, "text": "The court backed Tycho's right to tax and demand labor.", "start": 37.703, "end": 40.492}, {"beat": 3, "text": "You see, it is like needing silence to finish one hard puzzle.", "start": 40.912, "end": 44.126}, {"beat": 3, "text": "Tycho chose Hven for seclusion and royal support.", "start": 44.346, "end": 47.396}, {"beat": 3, "text": "Quiet helped Tycho focus on his observations.", "start": 47.616, "end": 50.144}, {"beat": 4, "text": "Tycho used quadrants, sextants, and clocks to watch the sky.", "start": 50.564, "end": 54.068}, {"beat": 4, "text": "A brass plumb line helped him adjust his instruments for accuracy.", "start": 54.288, "end": 57.751}, {"beat": 4, "text": "Tycho wanted to find the errors hidden inside his own instruments.", "start": 57.971, "end": 61.544}, {"beat": 5, "text": "Years later, Tycho dug a second observatory underground.", "start": 61.964, "end": 65.363}, {"beat": 5, "text": "Even his island instruments were not enough.", "start": 65.583, "end": 67.599}, {"beat": 5, "text": "Kepler later used Tycho's careful observations to write three laws about how planets move.", "start": 67.819, "end": 72.857}], "words": [{"w": "Tycho", "start": 0.145, "end": 0.495, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "Brahe", "start": 0.545, "end": 0.92, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "measured", "start": 0.995, "end": 1.295, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "stars", "start": 1.345, "end": 1.695, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "by", "start": 1.745, "end": 1.895, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "eye,", "start": 1.945, "end": 2.445, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "then", "start": 2.495, "end": 2.67, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "built", "start": 2.72, "end": 2.92, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "a", "start": 2.945, "end": 2.97, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "castle", "start": 3.02, "end": 3.345, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "around", "start": 3.395, "end": 3.67, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "them.", "start": 3.695, "end": 3.899, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "Tycho's", "start": 4.135, "end": 4.61, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "naked-eye", "start": 4.685, "end": 5.11, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "readings", "start": 5.16, "end": 5.685, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "had", "start": 5.76, "end": 5.847, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "to", "start": 5.847, "end": 5.935, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "be", "start": 5.96, "end": 6.035, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "exact.", "start": 6.06, "end": 6.544, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "King", "start": 6.786, "end": 6.986, "line": 2, "beat": 0}, {"w": "Frederick", "start": 7.036, "end": 7.286, "line": 2, "beat": 0}, {"w": "II", "start": 7.311, "end": 8.061, "line": 2, "beat": 0}, {"w": "wanted", "start": 8.161, "end": 8.361, "line": 2, "beat": 0}, {"w": "to", "start": 8.386, "end": 8.436, "line": 2, "beat": 0}, {"w"